---
/**
 * SEOAmenitiesContent.astro
 * Static SEO-enriching content block for /resort-amenities-mukteshwar/
 * Renders as pure server-side HTML — no client JS needed.
 */
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white border-t border-[#2C3531]/10">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase block mb-2">
        Property Details
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B3322]">
        What Makes Our Resort Amenities Stand Apart in Ramgarh
      </h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-[2px] bg-[#c9a832] mx-auto mt-4 mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Whispering Pines Resort in Malla Ramgarh is built on the principle that mountain remoteness should never mean compromised comfort. Every amenity on the property exists to bridge the gap between wilderness immersion and modern convenience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-16">

      <!-- Himalayan Views -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[-2rem] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#c9a832]/30"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase font-bold block mb-3">
            SECTION 1 — Signature USP
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-6">
            180° Himalayan Views from ALL Rooms — Wake Up to Nanda Devi & Trishul
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Every single room, suite, and private villa at Whispering Pines is architecturally oriented toward the unbroken Greater Himalayan ridgeline. Regardless of which room category you reserve, you wake up to direct, unobstructed 180° views of snow-crested Nanda Devi (7,816m), Trishul (7,120m), and the Panchachuli peaks right from your bed and private balcony. Unlike commercial hill station hotels where only premium categories face the valley, Whispering Pines guarantees a front-row Himalayan panorama for every single guest.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#FAF9F6] border-l-4 border-[#c9a832] p-6 md:p-8 rounded-r-sm shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#1B3322] uppercase font-bold">
                Guest Insight
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[#2C3531]/90 font-sans italic text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed m-0">
              "The sunrise over Nanda Devi right from our bedroom was unforgettable. We sat on the balcony with hot tea, watched the morning light turn the snow peaks gold, and enjoyed the best food in Ramgarh. Every room having this view makes Whispering Pines truly unique."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Swimming Pool -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[-2rem] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#c9a832]/30"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase font-bold block mb-3">
            SECTION 2 — Outdoor Pool
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-6">
            Open-Air Swimming Pool Surrounded by Pine Forest — One of the Few Near Mukteshwar
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Whispering Pines is one of the very few resorts on the Bhowali-Ramgarh-Mukteshwar corridor with an outdoor swimming pool. Positioned within the pine canopy at the edge of the property, the pool offers a rare combination of mountain air, forest shade, and Himalayan panorama. The pool area includes lounging chairs, poolside service, and a dedicated children's shallow section. Available seasonally from March through October, with water maintained at comfortable temperatures through solar heating.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Diverse Dining & Food Variety -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[-2rem] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#c9a832]/30"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase font-bold block mb-3">
            SECTION 3 — Culinary Variety
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-6">
            A Great Variety of Food — Homestyle Kumaoni Delicacies, Multi-Cuisine Dining & Bonfire BBQs
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            At Whispering Pines, dining is a cornerstone of your mountain relaxation. Our on-site kitchen serves an expansive variety of freshly prepared food: traditional Kumaoni recipes (such as Bhatt ki Churkani, Pahadi dal, and Mandua rotis), rich North Indian comfort classics, and customized continental choices. All meals are prepared using fresh, chemical-free vegetables sourced from nearby highland farms. Guests can enjoy breakfast under the sunny apple orchards, intimate balcony dinners facing the peaks, or lively evening bonfires accompanied by hot mountain appetizers and live charcoal barbecue setups. Seamless ambient Wi-Fi is also available across all grounds for effortless connectivity whenever needed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fireplace & Heating -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[-2rem] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#c9a832]/30"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase font-bold block mb-3">
            SECTION 4 — Warmth & Comfort
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-6">
            Wood-Burning Fireplaces, Geo-Heaters & Outdoor Bonfire Pit — Mountain Warmth Done Right
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Winter stays in the Kumaon Himalayas demand genuine warmth, not portable room heaters. Every suite and cottage at Whispering Pines features either an authentic stone-hearth wood-burning fireplace or high-capacity geo-heaters that maintain comfortable room temperatures even when outside conditions drop below 2°C. The outdoor bonfire pit, set within the front lawn garden with views of the Himalayan ridge, is prepared nightly with dry pine and oak logs — complimentary on arrival, with additional refills available at a nominal charge. Marshmallow sticks and grilling equipment are provided on request.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pet-Friendly -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[-2rem] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#c9a832]/30"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase font-bold block mb-3">
            SECTION 5 — Pet Friendly
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-6">
            Fully Pet-Friendly Estate — Secure Lawns, Forest Trails & Zero Pet Charges
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Whispering Pines is one of the few resorts near Mukteshwar that genuinely welcomes pets without restrictions or surcharges. The property features large, secure, enclosed front lawns where dogs can run freely, and direct access to wilderness pine forest walking paths. The gated perimeter ensures safety, and our staff is experienced in accommodating pets of all sizes. Water bowls and basic pet amenities are provided. Many guests specifically choose Whispering Pines because finding a premium, pet-friendly mountain resort with this level of space and security is exceptionally rare in Uttarakhand.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Power & Water -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[-2rem] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#c9a832]/30"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase font-bold block mb-3">
            SECTION 6 — Reliability
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-6">
            Uninterrupted Power & Hot Water — Generator Backup & Dual Water Pumping
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Mountain resorts frequently suffer from power cuts and water shortages — two issues that ruin an otherwise perfect stay. Whispering Pines has invested in high-capacity silent generators that activate automatically during grid outages, maintaining electricity for all rooms, kitchens, and common areas without interruption. Our dual-channel water pumping system draws from two independent sources, ensuring consistent hot water supply even during peak winter or high-occupancy periods. Guests never experience the power-and-water anxiety common at most hill station properties.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <div class="mt-20 text-center bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-[#2C3531]/10 rounded-sm p-8 md:p-12">
      <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Every amenity at Whispering Pines Resort is built for pure relaxation, genuine warmth, and unforgettable mountain memories. From waking up to 180° Himalayan views in every room to relishing a rich variety of fresh homestyle food — we have crafted each detail with authentic care.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact-whispering-pines-resort-mukteshwar/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 sm:px-10 sm:py-4 bg-[#1B3322] text-[#FAF9F6] hover:bg-[#c9a832] hover:text-[#1B3322] font-mono text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors duration-300 rounded-sm"
      >
        Enquire About Your Stay
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
